# pico-cam-a-camera

HM01B0 at 324 by 244, 8-bit grayscale over its one-bit serial output.
The SDK adapter owns sensor I2C setup and PIO/DMA capture; no overclock,
GPIO clock generation, or GPIO reset is needed. Capture waits for a fresh
FVLD edge and gives both frame synchronization and DMA one shared deadline.
